{"seq":1,"slug":"lc0142-linked-list-cycle-ii","title":"LeetCode 142 环形链表 II","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0142-linked-list-cycle-ii","wordCount":981,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-142-环形链表-ii\">LeetCode 142 环形链表 II</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个链表的头节点 <code>head</code>，返回链表开始入环的第一个节点。如果链表无环，则返回 <code>null</code>。</p>\n<p>如果链表中有某个节点，可以通过连续跟踪 <code>next</code> 指针再次到达，则链表中存在环。不允许修改链表。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>head = [3,2,0,-4]</code>，尾节点连接到索引 1 的节点</li>\n<li>输出：返回索引 1 的节点</li>\n<li>解释：链表中有一个环，其尾部连接到第二个节点</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>head = [1,2]</code>，尾节点连接到索引 0 的节点</li>\n<li>输出：返回索引 0 的节点</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>head = [1]</code>，无环</li>\n<li>输出：<code>null</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>链表中节点的数目范围在 <code>[0, 10^4]</code> 内</li>\n<li><code>-10^5 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 10^5</code></li>\n<li><code>pos</code> 为 <code>-1</code> 或链表中的一个有效索引</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>进阶：</strong> 你是否可以使用 O(1) 空间解决此题？</p>\n<p>本题是 LC #141（判断链表是否有环）的进阶版本。不仅需要判断是否有环，还要找到环的入口节点。Floyd 环检测算法在此展现了其数学之美。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"方法一-哈希集合\">方法一：哈希集合</h3><p>用 Set 记录访问过的节点，第一个重复访问的节点就是环的入口。简单直观但需要 O(n) 额外空间。</p>\n<h3 id=\"方法二-floyd-环检测算法\">方法二：Floyd 环检测算法</h3><p>Floyd 算法分两个阶段：</p>\n<p><strong>阶段一：判断是否有环。</strong> 使用快慢指针，快指针每次走 2 步，慢指针每次走 1 步。如果有环，两者一定会在环内某个位置相遇。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段二：找到环入口。</strong> 这是本题的精髓。当快慢指针相遇后，将其中一个指针重新放到头节点，两个指针都改为每次走 1 步，再次相遇的位置就是环的入口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数学证明\">数学证明</h3><p>设：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>链表头到环入口的距离为 <code>a</code></li>\n<li>环入口到相遇点的距离为 <code>b</code></li>\n<li>相遇点到环入口的距离为 <code>c</code>（沿环方向）</li>\n<li>环的周长为 <code>b + c</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>相遇时：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>慢指针走了 <code>a + b</code> 步</li>\n<li>快指针走了 <code>a + b + k(b + c)</code> 步（k 为快指针多走的圈数，k ≥ 1）</li>\n<li>快指针速度是慢指针的 2 倍：<code>2(a + b) = a + b + k(b + c)</code></li>\n<li>化简：<code>a + b = k(b + c)</code></li>\n<li>因此：<code>a = k(b + c) - b = (k-1)(b + c) + c</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>这意味着：<strong>从头节点走 a 步到达入口</strong> 等价于 <strong>从相遇点走 c 步再绕 (k-1) 圈到达入口</strong>。所以两个指针分别从头节点和相遇点出发，每次走 1 步，一定会在环入口相遇。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>哈希集合</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>简单直观</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Floyd 算法</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>数学推导精妙</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"方法一-哈希集合\">方法一：哈希集合</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class ListNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  next: ListNode | null;&#10;  constructor(val?: number, next?: ListNode | null) {&#10;    this.val = val ?? 0;&#10;    this.next = next ?? null;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function detectCycle(head: ListNode | null): ListNode | null {&#10;  const visited = new Set&lt;ListNode&gt;();&#10;  let current = head;&#10;&#10;  while (current !== null) {&#10;    if (visited.has(current)) {&#10;      return current;&#10;    }&#10;    visited.add(current);&#10;    current = current.next;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return null;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> detectCycle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">head</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> visited</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (visited.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    visited.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方法二-floyd-算法\">方法二：Floyd 算法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function detectCycle(head: ListNode | null): ListNode | null {&#10;  let slow = head;&#10;  let fast = head;&#10;&#10;  while (fast !== null &amp;&amp; fast.next !== null) {&#10;    slow = slow!.next;&#10;    fast = fast.next.next;&#10;&#10;    if (slow === fast) {&#10;      let entry = head;&#10;      while (entry !== slow) {&#10;        entry = entry!.next;&#10;        slow = slow!.next;&#10;      }&#10;      return entry;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return null;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> detectCycle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">head</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (fast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fast.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    slow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fast.next.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (slow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fast) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slow) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        entry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        slow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"执行过程示例\">执行过程示例</h3><p>以 <code>head = [3,2,0,-4]</code>，环入口为节点 2（索引 1），-4 连接到 2 为例：</p>\n<p><strong>阶段一：快慢指针寻找相遇点</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>slow</th>\n<th>fast</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>初始</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>slow+1, fast+2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>slow+1, fast+2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>相遇！</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>阶段二：寻找环入口</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>entry（从头出发）</th>\n<th>slow（从相遇点出发）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>entry === slow</code>，两者在节点 2 相遇，节点 2 就是环的入口。</p>\n<p>在此例中，<code>a = 1</code>（头到入口距离），<code>b = 2</code>（入口到相遇点），<code>c = 1</code>（相遇点到入口）。验证：<code>a = 1 = (1-1)(2+1) + 1 = c</code>，符合公式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>哈希集合</th>\n<th>Floyd 算法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> Floyd 算法中，阶段一快指针最多走 2n 步（n 为链表节点总数），慢指针走 n 步。阶段二两个指针各走最多 n 步。总共 O(n)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> Floyd 算法仅使用 <code>slow</code>、<code>fast</code>、<code>entry</code> 三个指针，空间为 O(1)。这是面试中的最优解，也是面试官期望看到的解法。</p>\n<p>Floyd 环检测算法是链表题中最具数学美感的算法之一。其核心思想——利用速度差制造相遇、利用距离关系定位入口——展现了算法设计中数学推理的力量。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 142 环形链表 II","id":"leetcode-142-环形链表-ii"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"方法一：哈希集合","id":"方法一-哈希集合"},{"level":3,"text":"方法二：Floyd 环检测算法","id":"方法二-floyd-环检测算法"},{"level":3,"text":"数学证明","id":"数学证明"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"方法一：哈希集合","id":"方法一-哈希集合"},{"level":3,"text":"方法二：Floyd 算法","id":"方法二-floyd-算法"},{"level":3,"text":"执行过程示例","id":"执行过程示例"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 56 合并区间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0056-merge-intervals"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 3 无重复字符的最长子串","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0003-longest-substring-without-repeating"}}